{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc4a <strong>The Ultimate Stress-Buster!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play HIT and take out your stress by pummelling, slapping, and whacking squishy clay heads in a VR sandbox. Thanks to our wild soft body physics, every hit deforms and reshapes the heads in hilariously unpredictable ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1742226006\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\ude93<strong>Choose Your Weapon</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fists, frying pans, baseball bats\u2014even a flopping fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1742226006\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc64<strong>30 Unique Heads to Wreck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each one reacts to your hits with funny voices and expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1742226006\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f<strong>Chill Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy in peace, surrounded by a tranquil paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1742226006\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our Discord and tell us what to add next!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555410?t=1742226006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/3866583c3727373185a81428979cbcbd6833b40c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742226006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/